   "id": null,
   "title": "Interior Design",
   "intro": "If this flagship’s exterior design can satisfy any mood, her stately interior is clearly a place of peace, combining serene colorways and materials with an exquisite study in physical comfort. The brand’s 140+ years of boatbuilding experience are on evident display, whether your attention lingers on the lighting, the volumes, the ergonomics or simply the overall fit and finish. Living aboard becomes just living, and that’s the way it should be.",
